Many people are concerned about which skills to develop to remain valuable as AI advances. Thomas suggests that the key is not to train for any specific occupation as it is today, but to focus on becoming as adaptable as possible.

@EchoShao8899: "Amazing to see a full room of people and get a lot of thought-provoking questions in our ACL 2026 tutorial on Future of Work with AI. You can find the slides on our website, and we will upload the recording once available."

The tutorial at ACL 2026 explores how the future of work will be shaped by large language models and AI, emphasizing adaptability as a crucial skill.

